  <item>
    <title>荷洲记23 - 聊聊世界杯、日本和荷兰的淘汰</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a46e5b59d2f57436841b087</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a46e5b59d2f57436841b087</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 02 Jul 2026 22:55:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>世界杯期间，忍不住想再谈谈足球——这项运动的魅力。</span></p><p><span>OP: 《世界的理想》 - 五条人；ED: 《侬要会做人》 - 顶楼马戏团；</span></p><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><p><span href="https://tarkochonsky.typlog.io/episodes/worldcup2026#t=03:35" data-url="https://tarkochonsky.typlog.io/episodes/worldcup2026#t=03:35"><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="215">03:35</a></span></u></span><span>&nbsp;我对世界杯扩军的看法；</span></p><p><span href="https://tarkochonsky.typlog.io/episodes/worldcup2026#t=11:00" data-url="https://tarkochonsky.typlog.io/episodes/worldcup2026#t=11:00"><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a></span></u></span><span>&nbsp;看足球就好比看电影，有烂片、翻拍和还有续集；</span></p><p><span href="https://tarkochonsky.typlog.io/episodes/worldcup2026#t=16:00" data-url="https://tarkochonsky.typlog.io/episodes/worldcup2026#t=16:00"><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a></span></u></span><span>&nbsp;足球真该死、足球真美妙——20024年的希腊、过去几届的克罗地亚、1992年的丹麦；</span></p><p><span href="https://tarkochonsky.typlog.io/episodes/worldcup2026#t=26:00" data-url="https://tarkochonsky.typlog.io/episodes/worldcup2026#t=26:00"><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a></span></u></span><span>&nbsp;这期节目的动机之一：对日本被淘汰的意难平；</span></p><p><span href="https://tarkochonsky.typlog.io/episodes/worldcup2026#t=43:00" data-url="https://tarkochonsky.typlog.io/episodes/worldcup2026#t=43:00"><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a></span></u></span><span>&nbsp;荷兰淘汰会影响经济吗？超市猝不及防本国球队被淘汰了……</span></p><p><span href="https://tarkochonsky.typlog.io/episodes/worldcup2026#t=46:45" data-url="https://tarkochonsky.typlog.io/episodes/worldcup2026#t=46:45"><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2805">46:45</a></span></u></span><span>&nbsp;在荷兰有很大的摩洛哥群体；</span></p><p><span href="https://tarkochonsky.typlog.io/episodes/worldcup2026#t=51:00" data-url="https://tarkochonsky.typlog.io/episodes/worldcup2026#t=51:00"><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">51:00</a></span></u></span><span>&nbsp;荷兰的传统治理理念之一：Pillarization</span></p><p><span href="https://tarkochonsky.typlog.io/episodes/worldcup2026#t=54:15" data-url="https://tarkochonsky.typlog.io/episodes/worldcup2026#t=54:15"><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3255">54:15</a></span></u></span><span>&nbsp;补充：范佩西的儿子选择了摩洛哥作为国家队；</span></p><p><span href="https://tarkochonsky.typlog.io/episodes/worldcup2026#t=62:00" data-url="https://tarkochonsky.typlog.io/episodes/worldcup2026#t=62:00"><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3720">62:00</a></span></u></span><span>&nbsp;赛后荷兰警察和摩洛哥球迷发生冲突</span></p><p><span href="https://tarkochonsky.typlog.io/episodes/worldcup2026#t=64:40" data-url="https://tarkochonsky.typlog.io/episodes/worldcup2026#t=64:40"><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3880">64:40</a></span></u></span><span>&nbsp;国民性、民族性到底是存在的吗？</span></p><p><span href="https://tarkochonsky.typlog.io/episodes/worldcup2026#t=70:00" data-url="https://tarkochonsky.typlog.io/episodes/worldcup2026#t=70:00"><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4200">70:00</a></span></u></span><span>&nbsp;很直的人，心理素质会比较不好吗？</span></p><p><span>--END--</span></p>]]></description>
